ation","c":"high","cited":"That is , \"put upon the Chruch-roll.\" From apostolic times as we know from I Tim. v. 9, 10, the Church had recognized the care of widows as a duty; but one to be exercised with caution, lest unworthy persons should take advantage of it. In Chrysostom's time there was an \"order of widows\", which had departed very much from the primitive simplicity and devotion to religious works which distinguished the order of earlier days. The Church strongly encouraged abstinence from a second marriage: and many women seem to have taken a vow of wodowhood, and secured a place in the Chruch-roll, only in the hope of throwing a decent veil over an irreligious, if not immoral life."},{"id":"8869960085be","b":"SIR","v":"npnf.chrysostomus.de_sacerdotio","w":"chrysostomus.de_sacerdotio","a":"johannes_chrysostomus","s":3,"p":[28,28],"r":[4,8],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"low","cited":"Ecclus iv. 8.","note":"Stellenangabe der Ausgabe (englische Zählung, nicht prüfbar)"},{"id":"656e32d95818","b":"SIR","v":"npnf.chrysostomus.de_sacerdotio","w":"chrysostomus.de_sacerdotio","a":"johannes_chrysostomus","s":3,"p":[28,28],"r":[18,15,18,17],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"low","cited":"Ecclus. xviii. 15-17.","note":"Stellenangabe der Ausgabe (englische Zählung, nicht prüfbar)"},{"id":"be0a89d45791","b":"SIR","v":"npnf.chrysostomus.de_sacerdotio","w":"chrysostomus.de_sacerdotio","a":"johannes_chrysostomus","s":3,"p":[31,31],"r":[42,9],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"low","cited":"Ecclus. xlii. 9.","note":"Stellenangabe der Ausgabe (englische Zählung, nicht prüfbar)"},{"id":"19146644777e","b":"MAT","v":"npnf.chrysostomus.de_sacerdotio","w":"chrysostomus.de_sacerdotio","a":"johannes_chrysostomus","s":3,"p":[31,31],"r":[3,10],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"high","cited":"Matt. iii. 10."},{"id":"73c62f36f01d","b":"2CO","v":"npnf.chrysostomus.de_sacerdotio","w":"chrysostomus.de_sacerdotio","a":"johannes_chrysostomus","s":3,"